      "role": "Heavenly Spirit Sect — Disciple (Beginner Class / 初级班) / Undercover Beastman of the Yellow Weasel Clan",
      "desc": "Dainty and adorable, barely five feet tall, with round cheeks and beady little eyes identical to Huang Xiao; far more street-smart and quick-witted than her brother, stepping on his foot whenever he almost exposes their animal clan roots; arrived early at the Library Pavilion's Shadow Cinema and knows how to use holographic tutorials; shares her brother's determination to stop Seventh Grandpa from ruining their clan's culinary reputation."
