      "desc": "Arrogant, experienced rogue cultivator who looks down on Lu Shulong's gentle, feminine appearance as a \"pretty boy\" who acts \"like an old woman\"; slacks off during field tutorials and falls straight into Lu Shulong's \"fishing\" trap, getting bound by mutant vines and forced to sample his own corrupted tissue before receiving antidote."
