      "desc": "Cautious, pragmatic, and ruthless ancient demon bug queen who survived the ancient God-Demon War; possesses a brain \"hardly meant for thinking\"; produces inaudible wing-friction frequencies to command her swarm; craves human meat above all else and views her endless generations of offspring as expendable scouts and cannon fodder."
