      "desc": "Bitingly sarcastic, courageous, and pragmatic ancient revolutionary who spent thousands of years researching how to disrupt the Ascension Stairway's mechanisms to end the parasitic siphoning of mortal realm resources by the upper realm; resolved alongside his dragon and demon allies to slay the rogue adult Taotie to protect future generations."
