      "desc": "The shadowy, illicit alter-ego and sockpuppet identity of the Palace of Carefree Wandering operating in the lawless Central Domain. Sells exotic goods, dangerous contraband, and illicit entertainment away from the strict regulations of orthodox sects. Currently hosting an assembly to exploit the newly unearthed secret realm."
