      "role": "Cultivation World",
      "desc": "Commercial storefronts and luxury entertainment complexes established by Carefree Palace across every major immortal market and city, foremost among them the premier entertainment pavilion in Sky City offering high-end wine, dance, rare auctions, and covert gray vices. Backed by stable supply lines, they offer quality-guaranteed pills, after-sales service for magical artifacts, and custom bespoke orders, serving as the default shopping and auction hub across the realms."
